```
Valid indices are `0 … database.length‑1`. With `<=`, the loop body executes with `i == database.length` (15), so `database[15]` throws `ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException` before the method can return anything. It must be `i < database.length`.

**Bug 2 – the fill loop uses the wrong index and the wrong bound.**
