## 1. Problems with the original method

The original method is:

```java
public static int mostFrequent(int[] arr) {
       int maxCount = 0;
       int mostFreq = arr[0];
       for (int i = 0; i < arr.length; i++) {
              int count = 0;
              for (int j = 0; j < arr.length; j++) {
